    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We are delighted to present this spacious and well-maintained family home to the market. Built in 2005, this timber-framed property, with strong kerb appeal, extends to approximately 142 sq. metres and is finished to a high standard throughout. Accommodation comprises Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen/Dining Room, Utility, Sun Porch, WC and Study/Bedroom on the ground floor, with four Bedrooms (including a master ensuite) and a family Bathroom on the first floor. Features include dual-fuel central heating, woodgrain-effect PVC double-glazed windows and doors, solid oak kitchen units and solid oak six-panel doors throughout. The attractive exterior combines an outshot with natural stone feature façade complemented by red brick quoins. Outside, the property benefits from a detached garage, generous tarmac driveway, providing ample parking, and landscaped gardens. It is conveniently located within walking distance of local amenities including shops, schools, churches, pubs, sports facilities and the scenic Monellan Woods. The outer leaf of the house has been found to contain higher than recommended levels of deleterious materials, a factor reflected in the guide price. Enquiries welcome, viewing by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall, Sitting Room, Kitchen-Diner, Utility Room, WC, 4 Bedrooms, (1 with ensuite) Office/5th Bedroom and Family Bathroom.<br><br>\nEntrance Hall - 4.8m x 1.2m (& 2m x 1m) <br>Composite front door,\nTiled floor, carried through to entire ground floor (with exception of Sun Porch), \nCarpeted stairs with painted spindles & Oak handrail,\nRadiator,\nUnder-stairs broom cupboard.<br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 5.0m x 4.0m <br>Tiled floor through from hallway,\nLarge front window,\nBlack granite fireplace with open fire with back boiler,\n2 No. 3 stem spot lights,\nDouble doors through to Kitchen-Diner.\nCoving to ceiling, \n2 No. radiators.<br><br><br>\nKitchen-Diner - 6.2m x 4.2m <br>Tiled floor,\nSolid oak high & low level kitchen units,\nStainless steel sink,\nIntegrated dishwasher, 4 ring electric hob & oven & extractor fan,\nIntegrated fridge-freezer,\n2 No picture windows in dining area, French doors & window at sink,\n2 No brushed chrome light fittings (4 spotlights on each),\n2 No radiators.<br><br><br>\nUtility - 2.0m x 2.0m <br>Tiled floor,\nLow level units,\nStainless steel sink,\nFuse Board, \nWindow & Radiator, \nDoor to sun porch.<br><br><br>\nSun Porch - 2.0m x 1.8m <br>Tiled floor,\nWrap-around windows & transparent perspex roof lending warmth & brightness,\nBack door.<br><br><br>\nWC - 2.0m x 1.2m <br>Tiled floor,\nWhite WHB & WC,\nWindow & Radiator.<br><br><br>\nOffice/5th Bedroom - 2.9m x 2.7m <br>Tiled floor,\nLarge window to front,\n5 stem chrome light fitting,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nStairs - <br>Carpeted stairs, oak handrail and painted spindles,\nTall stairwell window,\n2 No. decorative 2 stem wall lights.<br><br><br>\nLanding - 2.8m x 3.6m <br>Wood effect flooring,\n5 stem ceiling light matching wall lights on stairs\nAiring cupboard,\nAttic access<br><br><br>\nBedroom 1 - 4.4m x 3.3m <br>2 No windows to front,\nBuilt-in wardrobe,\nWood effect flooring,\n5 stem ceiling light,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nEnsuite - 2.4m x 1.2m <br>Fully tiled floor,\nHalf tiled walls,\nWhite WHB & WC,\nShower enclosure,\nExtractor fan,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 2.7m <br>2 No windows to front,\nBuilt-in wardrobe,\nWood effect flooring,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 3 - 3.5m x 2.7m <br>Window to rear,\nWood effect flooring,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nBedroom 4 - 3.5m x 3.0m <br>Window to rear,\nWood effect flooring,\nRadiator.<br><br><br>\nFamily Bathroom - 2.7m 2.4m <br>Fully tiled floor,\nHalf tiled walls,\nWhite vanity unit with WHB, \nWhite WC & Bath,\nSeparate shower with electric Triton T90sr shower unit, \nExtractor fan,\nRadiator,\nChrome heated towel rail,\nWindow to rear,\nFlush ceiling light fitting & extractor fan.<br><br><br>\nGarage - 7.0m x 5m <br>Number of plug sockets,\nSeparate fuse box,\nRoller shutter door.<br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
