        "Content": "Wood-grain effect PVC double glazed windows throughout,\nBright light-filled house,\nSolid Oak 6 panel doors throughout,\nDual fuel central heating,\nAlarmed,\nFully tarmaced driveway/street,\nShared right of way to public road,\nFootpath all the way into the Crossroads village."
      },
